{
  "bookId": "PSA",
  "chapter": 75,
  "bookEnglish": "Psalms",
  "bookChineseSimplified": "诗篇",
  "bookChineseTraditional": "詩篇",
  "verses": [
    {
      "verse": "1",
      "en": {
        "text": "We give thanks to you, God.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "神啊，我们称谢你，我们称谢你！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "上帝啊，我們稱謝你，我們稱謝你！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "2",
      "en": {
        "text": "When I choose the appointed time, I will judge blamelessly.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我到了所定的日期，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我到了所定的日期，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "3",
      "en": {
        "text": "The earth and all its inhabitants quake. I firmly hold its pillars.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "地和其上的居民都消化了；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "地和其上的居民都消化了；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "4",
      "en": {
        "text": "I said to the arrogant, “Don’t boast!” I said to the wicked, “Don’t lift up the horn.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "我对狂傲人说：不要行事狂傲！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "我對狂傲人說：不要行事狂傲！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "5",
      "en": {
        "text": "Don’t lift up your horn on high. with a stiff neck.”",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "不要把你们的角高举；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "不要把你們的角高舉；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "6",
      "en": {
        "text": "For neither from the east, nor from the west, yet from the south, comes exaltation.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "因为高举非从东，非从西，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "因為高舉非從東，非從西，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "7",
      "en": {
        "text": "But God is the judge. He puts down one, and lifts up another.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "惟有 神断定；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "惟有上帝斷定；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "8",
      "en": {
        "text": "For in the LORD’s hand there is a cup, of foaming wine mixed with spices. He pours it out. Indeed the wicked of the earth drink and drink it to its very dregs.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "耶和华手里有杯，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "耶和華手裏有杯，",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "9",
      "en": {
        "text": "But I will declare this forever: I will sing praises to the God of Jacob.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "但我要宣扬，直到永远！ 的 神！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "但我要宣揚，直到永遠！ 的上帝！",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    },
    {
      "verse": "10",
      "en": {
        "text": "I will cut off all the horns of the wicked, but the horns of the righteous shall be lifted up.",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhSimplified": {
        "text": "恶人一切的角，我要砍断；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      },
      "zhTraditional": {
        "text": "惡人一切的角，我要砍斷；",
        "footnotes": [],
        "crossReferences": []
      }
    }
  ]
}